function canShowPayouts(){ return isProtectedView(currentView) && canAccessView(currentView); }
function transformPercentText(text, view){
if(!text) return '';
view = payoutRuleView(view);
if(view !== 'internal' && view !== 't2') return text;
let output = String(text);
const protectedShares = [];
output = output.replace(/(\d+(?:\.\d+)?)%\s+of\s+NB\s+receivables/gi, (match, raw) => {
let converted;
if(view === 'internal'){
converted = 'Define 100% of NB receivables';
}else{
const n = parseFloat(raw);
const reduced = Math.max(0, n - 5);
const formatted = Number.isInteger(reduced)
? reduced.toFixed(0)
: reduced.toFixed(2).replace(/0+$/,'').replace(/\.$/,'');
converted = formatted + '% of NB Receivables';
}
const token = `__NB_RECEIVABLE_SHARE_${protectedShares.length}__`;
protectedShares.push(converted);
return token;
});
output = output.replace(/(\d+(?:\.\d+)?)%/g, (match, raw) => {
const n = parseFloat(raw);
let result = n;
if(view === 'internal') result = n / 0.90;
if(view === 't2') result = Math.max(0, n - 0.05);
result = Math.round((result + Number.EPSILON) * 100) / 100;
return result.toFixed(2) + '%';
});
protectedShares.forEach((value, index) => {
output = output.replace(`__NB_RECEIVABLE_SHARE_${index}__`, value);
});
return output;
}
